# VITE_API_BASE_URL is optional.
# Only set this if your backend runs on a different origin than the frontend.
# In local development, the Vite proxy handles /api -> http://127.0.0.1:8000
# In Vercel, the rewrite rules route /api/* to the backend service automatically.
#
# Example (if needed):
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.example.com